<http://purl.org/spatialai/stad/v2/mls#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> "Temporal aggregate data" .
<http://purl.org/spatialai/stad/v2/mls#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Spatial and Temporal Aggregate Data Ontology MLS extension (STAD-MLS)"@en .
